e": "15500", "image": "engenn5le17ob08re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes,  ok ... done. Next?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Carl</span>: Second, grab the ground coffee container and place 6 heaping tablespoons into the filter at the top.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Filter? Do I need a filter?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Carl</span>: Yes, take one of these ones. Put it into the basket. Then, add the coffee.", "id": 3, "time": "44000", "image": "engenn5le17ob08re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oops ... I just spilled some on the floor. I'll clean that up in a bit.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Carl</span>: Lastly, press brew.  It should take about 10 minutes.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Carl</span>: Can you bring me a coffee when it's ready? I'll be in the boardroom.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Absolutely! Thanks for your help.", "id": 4, "time": "62250", "image": "engenn5le17ob08re2img06.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le17ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le17ob08re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "How to Write Instructions", "id": 1, "time": "6000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class=\"bullet\">use sequencing words", "id": 2, "time": "19000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class=\"bullet\">use sequencing phrases", "id": 3, "time": "46000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class=\"bullet\">use chronological order, write clearly and use imperatives", "id": 4, "time": "60000", "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn5le17ob08re3vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "_data": [], "type": "video", "template_override": 1}]}]}